{"t": 1794780889585, "cmd": "note", "args": ["--shot", "confirm_timeout", "Build House needs a two-click confirm, but at the game's low frame rate (1-2 fps, tps ~10) the confirm window expired before the second click landed four times in a row ('Not confirmed in time, so nothing was done.', ticks 3668, 3756, 3840, 3904). Only two clicks fired back-to-back worked (House built, tick 3980). The confirm window seems to be ~60 ticks; it should be longer or wall-clock based."]}
