{"t": 1794781106581, "cmd": "note", "args": ["--shot", "stuck_in_settlement", "Inside the settlement, W/A/S/D and pt walkto do nothing (player x/z stayed 16.45/163.07 for ~1400 ticks) and Escape opens the pause menu rather than leaving. The only hint that you are 'inside' is the button row; the 3D view looks like the open world, so it feels like the character is frozen. Expected: Escape or walking to leave the settlement, or a clear 'You are inside X - press E/Exit to leave' banner."]}
