{"t": 1794781596296, "cmd": "note", "args": ["--shot", "perf_tps", "Game ran at 1-3 fps and 3-12 tps (target 50) for the whole session. At this rate day 2 (the Day 1/2 Village requirement, ~tick 21000 from the 0.30 start) is ~35 minutes of real time away, so the time gate could not be reached in a 30-minute session. Tick 8576 at timeOfDay 0.586."]}
